    {
      "source": "This implementation is not suitable with the <a href=\"RestClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClient</code></a> as it uses\na list of candidates where the first matching is invoked. If you want to\ndisable default status handlers with the <code>RestClient</code>, consider\nregistering a noop <a href=\"RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>ErrorHandler</code></a> with a\npredicate that matches all status code, see\n<a href=\"RestClient.Builder.html#defaultStatusHandler(java.util.function.Predicate,org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler)\"><code>RestClient.Builder.defaultStatusHandler(Predicate, ErrorHandler)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此实现不适用于使用候选者列表并调用第一个匹配项的<a href=\"RestClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClient</code></a>。如果您想禁用<code>RestClient</code>的默认状态处理器，请考虑注册一个无操作（noop）<a href=\"RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>ErrorHandler</code></a>，其谓词匹配所有状态码，请参阅<a href=\"RestClient.Builder.html#defaultStatusHandler(java.util.function.Predicate,org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler)\"><code>RestClient.Builder.defaultStatusHandler(Predicate, ErrorHandler)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations will typically inspect the\n<a href=\"../../http/client/ClientHttpResponse.html#getStatusCode()\"><code>HttpStatus</code></a> of the response.",
      "translation": "实现通常会检查响应的 <a href=\"../../http/client/ClientHttpResponse.html#getStatusCode()\"><code>HttpStatus</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
